OL,3,GNEWSABronze turtles statue stolen from
OL,4,Aart gallery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA thief has stolen a bronze sculpture
OL,7,Fof two turtles worth about #1,850 from
OL,8,Fan art gallery.
OL,10,FEntitled Turtle Duo by wildlife artist
OL,11,FStephen Rew, the work was taken from
OL,12,FAdrian Hill Fine Art in Stamford at
OL,13,Fabout 14:40 BST on 3 October,
OL,14,FLincolnshire Police said.
OL,16,FThe force issued a CCTV image of man
OL,17,Fseen leaving the gallery who "may have
OL,18,Finformation that could assist us in our
OL,19,Finvestigation".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
